# Suspicious LDAP-Attributes Used | T1001.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/win_security_susp_ldap_dataexchange.yml
source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=5136 AttributeValue="*" (AttributeLDAPDisplayName IN ("primaryInternationalISDNNumber", "otherFacsimileTelephoneNumber", "primaryTelexNumber"))
